# Desktop/dev DNF packages for graphical Fedora/RHEL machines (display = true).
# Installed by run_after_19-linux-desktop-dnf.sh (stamp-and-compare).
# Distinct from bootstrap.dnf: those are minimal pre-Homebrew prereqs on EVERY
# Fedora machine; these are packages only a machine with a display needs.
#
# The vendor-repo apps below need their DNF repos, which are provisioned
# first by run_onchange_before_16-linux-desktop-repos-dnf.sh (runs in the
# *before* group). GUI apps available on Flathub come from the Brewfile's
# `flatpak` entries instead; only apps whose best Fedora channel is a vendor
# DNF repo live here.
#
# Names only, one per line — the installer extracts via `grep -Ev '^#|^$'`.

# Vendor-repo desktop apps (repos set up by the before-hook above):
#   code (VS Code) -> packages.microsoft.com/yumrepos/vscode
code
